ttps://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/47/qfmvst9n4k4nx1pzuxb6erllnopa4su.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%87%83%E7%83%A7%E7%93%B6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/47/qfmvst9n4k4nx1pzuxb6erllnopa4su.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%87%83%E7%83%A7%E7%93%B6.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/47/qfmvst9n4k4nx1pzuxb6erllnopa4su.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />燃烧瓶•改\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>曲射、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（穿透伤害）对目标地点<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有敌人，造成其<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>最大生命值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，使地形格强制变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"燃烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">燃烧</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b5/4cyaxvme10nbxvb0dprbjkm2p12efho.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b5/4cyaxvme10nbxvb0dprbjkm2p12efho.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E4%B9%8B%E5%85%89%E7%81%AB%E6%9C%AF%E5%B8%88\" title=\"角色图鉴库/黑暗之光火术师\"><img alt=\"头像 黑暗之光火术师.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/93/snlhjs3whflbzc36kw8at8g7o2ab1ul.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">黑暗之光火术师</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%80%85%E5%BC%93%E5%85%B5\" title=\"角色图鉴库/无法者弓兵\"><img alt=\"头像 无法者弓兵.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/76/rke1gepdewctyrl1dyfzhu9yoe5f40g.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style